                "svg": "<svg width=\"575\" height=\"98\"><text font-family=\"Segoe UI\" font-size=\"8.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">1.Configure the hostname of SW1,SW2 and R1\n2.configure the appropriate IP addresses on R1,PC1,PC2,PC3,PC4\n3.Manualy configure the speed and duplex on interfaces connected to ther networking devices(not end hosts)\n4.Configure appropriate descriptions on each interface\n5.Disable interfaces with are not connected to other devices\n6.Save the configurations</text></svg>",
